public class MyTransformer implements ClassTransformer {
    @Override
    public byte[] transform(ClassFileTransformer transformer, ClassFile cf) {
        // Get the method count of the class
        int methodCount = cf.getMethodCount();

        // Loop through each method and add a logging instruction
        for (int i = 0; i < methodCount; i++) {
            Method method = cf.getMethod(i);
            // Add a logging instruction at the start of the method
            method.setCode(cf.getCode().insert(new byte[] {(byte) 0x01, 0x00}, 0));
        }

        // Return the modified class file
        return cf.getCode();
    }
}
```
This transformer logs every method call by inserting a `1i` bytecode instruction at the start of each method.

**Example 2: Transforming a class to instrument a specific method**
